# Verible lint rules for this project, read by Neovim's Verilog language server
# (searched upward from each file). One rule per line: +rule enables, -rule
# disables, rule=option:value configures. All rules and their options:
#   verible-verilog-lint --help_rules=all
+line-length=length:120
-explicit-parameter-storage-type
